error: account close should be preceded by zeroing the same account's data
  --> $DIR/account_close.rs:466:2
   |
LL |     state.close()?;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: close with `account.close_account_zeroed(&ID, recipient)?` (or the `CloseAccountZeroed` builder), which zeroes the data and closes in one step
   = help: to keep a separate close, first clear the whole data buffer of the same account with `account.try_borrow_mut()?.fill(0);`
   = help: known limits: after the fill, writes through `pina`, `pinocchio`, or `solana_account_view` methods, CPIs, and separately obtained handles to the account are not tracked, nor are lends after the close inside a loop
   = note: `#[deny(require_zeroed_before_close)]` on by default

